<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'CleanTime.live - Recovery Time Calculator' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="shell">
        <%- include('partials/masthead') %>

        <div class="stack">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">For recovery events &amp; groups</span>
                <h1 class="page-title">Celebrate the clean time in the room, together.</h1>
            </div>

            <p class="lede">CleanTime.live lets an event or group gather members’ clean dates and show the combined total during celebrations, anniversaries and special occasions.</p>

            <section class="card" aria-labelledby="how-title">
                <h2 id="how-title" class="card__title">How it works</h2>
                <ol class="steps">
                    <li>Each event or group gets its own private space.</li>
                    <li>Members scan a QR code and submit their clean date on their phone.</li>
                    <li>CleanTime.live works out the years, months and days.</li>
                    <li>Put the combined total up on the screen and celebrate.</li>
                </ol>
            </section>

            <section class="card" aria-labelledby="request-title">
                <h2 id="request-title" class="card__title">Request a space</h2>
                <p class="muted">CleanTime.live isn’t self-service. To request a space for your event or group, open an issue on GitHub.</p>
                <a class="button button--block"
                   href="https://github.com/bmlt-enabled/diffcalc/issues/new?title=Request%20new%20group%20space&amp;body=Group%20name:%0AContact%20email:%0A">
                    Request a space
                </a>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <p>CleanTime.live is a free service for recovery communities.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
